The quantization adapter uses LLM Compressor's AWQ example and public APIs.
Quantization kernels, AWQ scaling, packing and execution remain upstream work.
https://github.com/vllm-project/llm-compressor

The optional receipt adapter reads NAVER CLOVA CORD-v2 annotations and images
under CC-BY-4.0. The source archive includes five unmodified review images and
annotation ledgers from the pinned CORD-v2 experiment, attributed to NAVER CLOVA
and CORD dataset contributors. See the image-specific notice and hashes in
experiments/results/2026-10-05/cord-service/review-images/NOTICE.md and the adjacent
manual-review.json. Full image sets and source parquet data are not bundled.
